WEBVTT

1
00:00:30.238 --> 00:00:32.532
So far there has been talk of the proper place,

2
00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:36.077
proper posture, and proper process for yoga.

3
00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:38.663
Now here, Lord Krishna is talking about

4
00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:40.874
the main purpose of yoga.

5
00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:47.380
Lord Krishna says’

6
00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:51.051
that one who practices yoga 
with self-restraint and controlled mind

7
00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:54.345
becomes free from material bondages.

8
00:00:54.345 --> 00:00:57.098
They attain infinite peace,

9
00:00:57.098 --> 00:01:01.227
and ultimately, enter my supreme abode,

10
00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:04.898
meaning, they come and meet me.

11
00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:09.027
The main thing to understand 
is that the real purpose of yoga

12
00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:10.445
is not to gain

13
00:01:10.445 --> 00:01:13.114
physical benefits or material pleasures,

14
00:01:13.114 --> 00:01:16.493
but to attain supreme peace,

15
00:01:16.493 --> 00:01:18.828
to connect with Paramātmā.

16
00:01:18.828 --> 00:01:22.207
And this verse clarifies that a yogi,

17
00:01:22.207 --> 00:01:26.002
by controlling their body, mind, and actions,

18
00:01:26.002 --> 00:01:28.797
can attain such a high state

19
00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:31.466
where they go beyond all worldly bondages.

20
00:01:31.466 --> 00:01:34.844
And only one who is not bound

21
00:01:34.844 --> 00:01:38.473
can progress on the spiritual path.

22
00:01:38.473 --> 00:01:39.349
When a yogi

23
00:01:39.349 --> 00:01:42.685
is free from worldly and material cravings,

24
00:01:42.685 --> 00:01:44.354
they can establish a deep connection

25
00:01:44.354 --> 00:01:48.191
with Paramātmā residing within themselves.

26
00:01:48.191 --> 00:01:50.193
The sweetness of this connection

27
00:01:50.193 --> 00:01:52.987
and the peace obtained from it

28
00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:56.449
is infinite, unimaginable.

29
00:02:01.204 --> 00:02:02.455
Most people

30
00:02:02.455 --> 00:02:07.335
don't understand how powerful the mind is.

31
00:02:07.335 --> 00:02:09.629
Even small attempts to control the mind

32
00:02:09.629 --> 00:02:14.801
can bring big changes in life.

33
00:02:14.801 --> 00:02:16.261
In today's age,

34
00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:19.180
a person is surrounded from all sides.

35
00:02:19.180 --> 00:02:23.935
As if there is an abundance
 of information everywhere.

36
00:02:23.935 --> 00:02:25.645
Who achieved what,

37
00:02:25.645 --> 00:02:28.898
who bought a new car, who got promoted.

38
00:02:28.898 --> 00:02:30.567
As if there's a race for success

39
00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:34.154
and a competition for happiness.

40
00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:37.991
Or just take these modern devices –

41
00:02:37.991 --> 00:02:38.908
and every moment

42
00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:43.580
who knows how many 
attention-distracting messages.

43
00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.456
There are countless reasons

44
00:02:45.456 --> 00:02:47.584
that distract a person's attention,

45
00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:49.335
which keep them restless

46
00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:53.047
and distance them from deep peace.

47
00:02:53.047 --> 00:02:57.260
Think – if you move away from all these sources

48
00:02:57.260 --> 00:03:00.763
that disturb the mind and distract attention,

49
00:03:00.763 --> 00:03:05.185
even for just a few moments,

50
00:03:05.185 --> 00:03:07.812
what would be its effect?

51
00:03:07.812 --> 00:03:10.982
Yes, this step may seem small,

52
00:03:10.982 --> 00:03:15.111
but its impact will be big in the future.

53
00:03:15.111 --> 00:03:16.446
Understand it like this:

54
00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:19.282
just as the body's muscles

55
00:03:19.282 --> 00:03:22.493
become strong by gradually lifting weight,

56
00:03:22.493 --> 00:03:26.414
in the same way these 
small controls over the mind

57
00:03:26.414 --> 00:03:30.376
strengthen your willpower.

58
00:03:30.376 --> 00:03:33.713
Gradually this has a positive effect

59
00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:35.256
on your thoughts, your emotions,

60
00:03:35.256 --> 00:03:38.968
and your actions – all of them.

61
00:03:38.968 --> 00:03:40.929
Then small cravings

62
00:03:40.929 --> 00:03:43.097
don't disturb you.

63
00:03:43.097 --> 00:03:44.641
In small sorrows

64
00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:47.518
you don't get disturbed like before.

65
00:03:47.518 --> 00:03:52.273
You start remaining more peaceful than before.

66
00:03:52.273 --> 00:03:55.235
You also start to realize

67
00:03:55.235 --> 00:03:57.946
that your life is not dependent on others' praise

68
00:03:57.946 --> 00:04:02.492
or approval, and internal happiness

69
00:04:02.492 --> 00:04:06.537
is far more valuable than social show.

70
00:04:06.537 --> 00:04:08.831
Now think, what a big

71
00:04:08.831 --> 00:04:12.126
and positive change this is.

72
00:04:12.126 --> 00:04:14.712
And as I said, for this

73
00:04:14.712 --> 00:04:16.214
there's no need to take

74
00:04:16.214 --> 00:04:18.716
very big steps,

75
00:04:18.716 --> 00:04:22.178
nor do many changes have 
to be made all at once.

76
00:04:22.178 --> 00:04:26.266
One by one, start with small disciplines.

77
00:04:26.266 --> 00:04:27.850
For example,

78
00:04:27.850 --> 00:04:29.852
someone started exercising for a few moments,

79
00:04:29.852 --> 00:04:33.398
and when this became a habit,

80
00:04:33.398 --> 00:04:36.818
then they took time for self-reflection daily

81
00:04:36.818 --> 00:04:37.777
by keeping modern

82
00:04:37.777 --> 00:04:41.698
devices away for a few moments.

83
00:04:41.698 --> 00:04:44.033
Gradually all these small

84
00:04:44.033 --> 00:04:47.328
changes become a good habit,

85
00:04:47.328 --> 00:04:51.666
and before you know it, 
the entire life can change.

86
00:04:51.666 --> 00:04:56.004
This is the path to complete
 control over the mind.

87
00:04:56.004 --> 00:05:00.174
Not all at once, but gradually, one by one.

88
00:05:00.174 --> 00:05:03.011
Then that day is not far when
 you will become the master

89
00:05:03.011 --> 00:05:07.682
of this restless mind. And then, this same mind

90
00:05:07.682 --> 00:05:10.393
will also become capable of taking you

91
00:05:10.393 --> 00:05:14.689
on the path of complete spiritual progress.

92
00:05:18.943 --> 00:05:23.031
In family settings, occasions 
of tension, confusion,

93
00:05:23.031 --> 00:05:25.700
and discord arising

94
00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.660
is a simple matter.

95
00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:30.121
After all, people with different thoughts

96
00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:31.873
and perspectives

97
00:05:31.873 --> 00:05:34.625
live together under one roof.

98
00:05:34.625 --> 00:05:35.585
But

99
00:05:35.585 --> 00:05:38.296
you must have also seen such families

100
00:05:38.296 --> 00:05:41.215
where love remains among everyone.

101
00:05:41.215 --> 00:05:43.843
Where there are no fights.

102
00:05:43.843 --> 00:05:49.265
Does this mean everyone's
 thinking is the same there?

103
00:05:49.265 --> 00:05:53.019
Or no occasion for dispute arises there?

104
00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:54.771
It's not so.

105
00:05:54.771 --> 00:05:57.398
Those families also have differences,

106
00:05:57.398 --> 00:05:58.608
but still

107
00:05:58.608 --> 00:06:03.571
there is only one secret to
 mutual love remaining –

108
00:06:03.571 --> 00:06:06.324
self-restraint.

109
00:06:06.324 --> 00:06:10.370
Keeping emotions balanced during disputes,

110
00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:14.290
and controlling the mind in moments of impulse.

111
00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:17.251
Often even a small moment of anger

112
00:06:17.251 --> 00:06:19.796
or ego between two people

113
00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:22.382
can become a big dispute.

114
00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:26.135
But if in that one moment,

115
00:06:26.135 --> 00:06:30.098
one of them shows wisdom, remains calm,

116
00:06:30.098 --> 00:06:33.601
controls their mind, then the fight

117
00:06:33.601 --> 00:06:37.480
stops before it escalates.

118
00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.566
Even just a few moments of restraint

119
00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:44.487
plays a big role in maintaining family harmony.

120
00:06:44.487 --> 00:06:45.488
In reality,

121
00:06:45.488 --> 00:06:49.575
this is the form of yoga in family life –

122
00:06:49.575 --> 00:06:52.829
patience and self-restraint.

123
00:06:52.829 --> 00:06:56.833
When one person shows such behavior,

124
00:06:56.833 --> 00:07:01.838
it has a positive effect on other members too.

125
00:07:01.838 --> 00:07:04.465
They also start to understand that

126
00:07:04.465 --> 00:07:05.842
disputes could be resolved

127
00:07:05.842 --> 00:07:07.927
peacefully too.

128
00:07:07.927 --> 00:07:11.514
Possibly they also realize

129
00:07:11.514 --> 00:07:13.599
that they too could have found solutions

130
00:07:13.599 --> 00:07:15.852
by avoiding anger.

131
00:07:15.852 --> 00:07:18.646
This very thinking and reflection

132
00:07:18.646 --> 00:07:22.108
initiates a small change in them too.

133
00:07:22.108 --> 00:07:24.026
Ultimately, these very small

134
00:07:24.026 --> 00:07:27.280
steps maintain the unity

135
00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.990
of the family.

136
00:07:28.990 --> 00:07:31.742
Yoga also teaches all this –

137
00:07:31.742 --> 00:07:32.952
self-restraint,

138
00:07:32.952 --> 00:07:35.913
balance of emotions, control over the mind.

139
00:07:35.913 --> 00:07:42.795
Therefore, yoga can become a 
great foundation of family love.

140
00:07:42.795 --> 00:07:44.422
Think about it.

141
00:07:48.843 --> 00:07:52.305
In professional settings, occasions for tension

142
00:07:52.305 --> 00:07:55.516
between two people arising is natural.

143
00:07:55.516 --> 00:07:58.519
One also has to face criticism.

144
00:07:58.519 --> 00:08:01.689
But sometimes in haste,

145
00:08:01.689 --> 00:08:04.484
a person says something in anger

146
00:08:04.484 --> 00:08:07.153
that worsens the matter.

147
00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:10.448
It doesn't take long for a big dispute to form

148
00:08:10.448 --> 00:08:13.784
from a small wrong comment.

149
00:08:13.784 --> 00:08:16.329
Once something is said in impulse,

150
00:08:16.329 --> 00:08:18.748
correcting it later

151
00:08:18.748 --> 00:08:20.374
becomes difficult.

152
00:08:20.374 --> 00:08:23.711
Therefore, practice of self-restraint

153
00:08:23.711 --> 00:08:25.630
is very important.

154
00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:28.132
Think – if a colleague

155
00:08:28.132 --> 00:08:30.676
criticizes your ideas,

156
00:08:30.676 --> 00:08:32.637
anger can come.

157
00:08:32.637 --> 00:08:35.765
In that one moment, giving a sharp reaction

158
00:08:35.765 --> 00:08:37.141
is very easy,

159
00:08:37.141 --> 00:08:40.520
but then the disagreement arising from it

160
00:08:40.520 --> 00:08:43.064
doesn't resolve easily.

161
00:08:43.064 --> 00:08:46.400
But if you take a small pause,

162
00:08:46.400 --> 00:08:48.402
handle your emotions,

163
00:08:48.402 --> 00:08:51.656
and then respond properly,

164
00:08:51.656 --> 00:08:53.950
then not only will the dispute reduce,

165
00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:54.700
but

166
00:08:54.700 --> 00:08:58.579
other people will also see your wisdom.

167
00:08:58.579 --> 00:09:02.250
Other people will also understand that
you believe in resolving disputes

168
00:09:02.250 --> 00:09:06.879
and working together with others.

169
00:09:06.879 --> 00:09:12.677
And this is a very important aspect
of professional leadership.

170
00:09:12.677 --> 00:09:15.346
By becoming emotional, by coming under impulse,

171
00:09:15.346 --> 00:09:19.392
a person becomes confused from their real purpose.

172
00:09:19.392 --> 00:09:20.476
But if you

173
00:09:20.476 --> 00:09:23.354
keep your emotions controlled,

174
00:09:23.354 --> 00:09:28.025
you rise above minor upheavals.

175
00:09:28.025 --> 00:09:31.070
You move forward with a long-term thinking,

176
00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:34.365
focused only on the goal.

177
00:09:34.365 --> 00:09:37.410
Self-restraint increases mutual understanding,

178
00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.996
prevents you from wandering,

179
00:09:39.996 --> 00:09:43.499
keeps your mind focused on the purpose.

180
00:09:43.499 --> 00:09:47.295
And this is the path to lasting success.
